#! saves ending
# The ending: the original's own stage-1 turn-1 autosave with the next stage
# set to 0 (the "ending" fixture). Auto-battle is re-armed every 900 frames
# (it covers one turn: Esc twice, a click off the map, 自動作戰, confirm), the stage is
# won, then the ending sequence (epilogues, results) runs with the same keys.
